    <data key="d0">Eurovision Services Live Video Ingest and Distribution Architecture</data>
    <data key="d1">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eFQNwelGLhA</data>
    <data key="d2">Redundant, high-availability architecture for live IP video broadcasting, ingestion, transcoding, and worldwide distribution using AWS Elemental MediaConnect, Direct Connect, EC2, S3, and CloudFront.</data>
